  <running_head>EVANGELI. SECULI. IV.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">Illis oblationes erant signa charitatis:</l>
    <l n="2">his sunt redemptiones animarum, sed</l>
    <l n="3">accedo ad</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="1" para="true">PARALLELUM I.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Calvinus lib. III. Instit. cap. 5:5.</l>
    <l n="6">10, 11. reiicit preces pro defunctis</l>
    <l n="7">1. quia destituuntur testimoniis &amp;</l>
    <l n="8">exemplis scripturae sacrae. 2. quòd</l>
    <l n="9">veteres ipsi confitebantur. 3. quia</l>
    <l n="10">quicquid hic factum ab antiquis, pub-</l>
    <l n="11">lico mori &amp; vulgi imperitiae datum,</l>
    <l n="12">aut amori defunctorum. Idcirco ad</l>
    <l n="13">imitationem non esse trahendum.</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">At Harscherus contra instat &amp;</l>
    <l n="15">primò <i>testimoniys scripturae nititur os ob-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>struere Calvino.</i> Deinde <i>ex tribus hypo-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>thesibus Calvini &amp; Orthodoxorum circa</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>hanc quaestionem, doctrinam, in solidum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>everti, demonstrare conatur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20" para="true">De testimoniis scripturae primò.M</l>
    <l n="21">1. Regum</l>
  </main_text>
